<title>JAPAN: IBM LAUNCHES 4.0% YEN/DLR SAMURAI - DAIWA.</title>
<headline>IBM LAUNCHES 4.0% YEN/DLR SAMURAI - DAIWA.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following yen/dollar dual currency samurai issue was announced by lead-manager Daiwa Securities on Monday:</p>
<p> BORROWER International Business Machines Corp (IBM)</p>
<p> AMT 20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON 4.0 pct</p>
<p> ISS PRICE par</p>
<p> MATURITY	  27 Feb 2001</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  29 Aug 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	Aug 18 to Aug 28</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     S&amp;P A, Moody's A1</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Daiwa Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Fuji Bank</p>
<p>NOTES: The exchange rate was fixed at $4,538.03 per 500,000 yen.</p>
<p>---Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8785</p>
</text>
